 JsonBridge/ChanMotorPoints.cpp  | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 WebMotorAccess.cpp              | 10 +++++++---
 WebMotorAccess.h                |  9 +++++++++
 WebMotorAccessLive.cpp          | 13 +++++++++++++
